### get user
GET https://echo.free.beeceptor.com/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv TOKEN}}
X-Custom: {{custom_header}}

### get post
GET https://echo.free.beeceptor.com/api/posts/1

### create user
POST https://echo.free.beeceptor.com/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{username}}",
  "email": "{{email}}"
}
